PATCH 5 — Gate the anime.js hero draw on reduced motion (anime-animejs.jsx)
Add as the FIRST line of animateHeroDiagram():

  if (typeof window !== 'undefined' &&
      window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) {
    document.querySelectorAll('.hero-diagram svg path').forEach((p) => {
      p.style.strokeDashoffset = '0';
    });
    return;
  }

Also fix the malformed selector in animateOnScroll() — it must be ONE string:
  animate('.sectors .sector-list li, .values .value-card, .service-card, .process .step, .capabilities .cap-item', { ... })

NOTE: the full corrected module is provided as anime-animejs.jsx (supersedes this diff).
